# Chapter VI, Enderal: the pass through the Black Mountains, the siege of the
# Trun Telur fortress (Enderalvar 1 to 12), the dead city, and the player's
# brother at the portal. The fortress steps follow its scripts: arrive, open
# the outer gate, scout until the fireball cannons fire, the inner gate, the
# wall, a night's rest in the camp, the wall again, the gate square, the
# collapsing walls, the wall a last time, and the gate out.
# Position stands in for the walks; ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from enderal_pass
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# The pass. The third marker force-greets Mauragin in the frame his own
# script still holds him disabled, which OpenMW's ForceGreeting skips; his
# line only says he will follow later.
case enderal_pass
run
player->Position 98947 -146450 3266 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalPass == 1
run
player->Position 108391 -146070 7497 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalPass == 2
run
player->Position 116740 -163130 10985 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalPass == 3
end

# Trun Telur: the arrival and the outer gate. From the arrival on the player
# walks (Jarko, Gargart and Calisto follow), and uses each gate door from its
# own landing.
case enderal_burg_gate
run
player->Position 136217 -143308 4770 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBurg == 1
walk 140500 -143235 5714
activate 05BC8A49
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBurg == 2
# The journal is set on the click; the gate's landing (y -143673) comes after it.
until 300 player->GetPos Y < -143500
end

# Scouting the walls sets off the fireball cannons; the inner gate.
case enderal_burg_scout
pace 10
defend
walk 143300 -147900 4649
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBurg == 3
walk 143023 -145863 5158
until 300 Enderalvar == 3
walk 140730 -143673 5744
activate 05D5AC07
until 300 Enderalvar == 5
end

# The wall, then the camp: a soldier sends the player to bed.
case enderal_burg_camp
pace 10
# From the gate square the wall's only route runs ~2500 round the fortress wall,
# by the low ground: walked in legs on that route (as enderal_burg_battle).
walk 139343 -142146 5503
walk 138638 -141749 5442
walk 138955 -141109 5716
walk 138888 -141658 5892
walk 138577 -142471 5915
walk 138792 -143012 6079
walk 139051 -143404 6378
walk 139564 -144003 6550
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBurg == 4
walk 138526 -142621 5886
until 300 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
walk 136989 -140496 5445
activate 05289DC2
sleep 8
button 0
expect Enderalvar == 7
end

# Morning: the wall, the gate square, the walls come down, the wall again.
case enderal_burg_battle
walk 139564 -144003 6550
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBurg == 5
# The square is ~1000 east of the wall but its only route runs ~2500 west, past
# the camp and round by the low ground: walked in legs on that route.
walk 138832 -143102 6118
walk 138539 -142743 5883
walk 138766 -141809 5981
walk 138955 -141109 5716
walk 138700 -141906 5436
walk 139343 -142146 5503
walk 139801 -142921 5546
walk 140292 -143227 5584
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBurg == 6
walk 138779 -141927 5450
until 300 Enderalvar == 10
expect "a_Enderal_Mauer_Einsturz01"->GetDisabled == 1
walk 138713 -141200 5609
walk 138955 -141109 5716
walk 138888 -141658 5892
walk 138577 -142471 5915
walk 138792 -143012 6079
walk 139051 -143404 6378
walk 139564 -144003 6550
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBurg == 7
walk 138832 -143102 6118
walk 138539 -142743 5883
walk 138766 -141809 5981
walk 138955 -141109 5716
walk 138700 -141906 5436
walk 139343 -142146 5503
walk 139801 -142921 5546
walk 140500 -143235 5714
activate 05BC8A49
until 300 Enderalvar == 12
end

# The dead city, and the bridge of Mergtwen.
case enderal_city
run
player->Position 143606 -155330 4170 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalStadt == 1
run
player->Position 151404 -176610 5127 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalStadt == 2
end

# The marked figure at the portal is the player's brother.
case enderal_brother
# The fleeing marker's box opens only within 1000 of it while it flies 300 a game second: ~3 game s.
pace 2
run
player->Position 142712 -190400 10550 180
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
choose 5
choose 6
choose 7
choose 8
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VI_EnderalBruder == 2
expect EnderalTurmvar == 8
run
set TestResult to ( "MarkerEnderalTurm01"->GetPos x )
player->SetPos x TestResult
set TestResult to ( "MarkerEnderalTurm01"->GetPos y )
player->SetPos y TestResult
set TestResult to ( "MarkerEnderalTurm01"->GetPos z )
player->SetPos z TestResult
button 0
until 300 GetPCCell "Calisto's House" == 1
end
# The player flees; the tower wavers and the player wakes in Calisto's house.
# Its marker flies north at MoveWorld Y 300 from EnderalTurmvar 8, so the run
# to it shares the brother's case: no checkpoint lands between them. The player
# is set on it wherever it has flown to, in the cells loaded around the brother.
# See: docs/audits/headless_quest_runs.md#3-found-not-fixed
